{"reference":"1 Kings 18","book":"1 Kings","chapter":18,"status":"pending","sections":[{"kind":"chapter_overview","title":"Overview","blocks":[{"id":"block_1","text":"The contest at Carmel brings the chapter’s central question into public view: who is truly God? The LORD answers by fire, the people confess that the LORD is God, and rain returns after the drought. These events frame the chapter as a decisive confrontation over Israel’s allegiance.","verse_refs":["1 Kings 18:20-46"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_1_kings_018_cda7a1a42d0189269d7e59b1"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"fact"}]},{"kind":"interpretive_questions","title":"A Difficult Scene","blocks":[{"id":"block_2","text":"Elijah’s command to seize and kill Baal’s prophets belongs within the narrative’s ancient covenant and royal crisis. It should not be read as authorization for religious violence by modern readers.","verse_refs":["1 Kings 18:20-40"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_1_kings_018_dbf84e570ddde01ba19ba46f"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]},{"kind":"why_it_matters","title":"Elijah and Prayer","blocks":[{"id":"block_3","text":"Elijah’s prayer is later presented as the prayer of a human being like his audience, associated with drought and renewed rain. That connection encourages prayer, but it does not turn weather control or prosperity into a guaranteed technique.","verse_refs":["1 Kings 18:1-46"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_1_kings_018_c8d23f3f3ba651917959dd70"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"disputed"}]},{"kind":"surrounding_passages","title":"Ahab Beyond This Chapter","blocks":[{"id":"block_4","text":"The Kurkh Monolith names Ahab in a coalition at Qarqar, an event not narrated in 1 Kings. It independently places an Israelite king within ninth-century regional politics, though it does not establish every detail or theological claim made in the book.","verse_refs":["1 Kings 16:29-34","1 Kings 17:1-24","1 Kings 19:1-21","1 Kings 20:1-43","1 Kings 21:1-29","1 Kings 22:1-40"],"provenance_refs":["reader_path_1_kings_018_0f4432165ca17d0b79b04aee"],"confidence":"high","interpretation_level":"inference"}]}],"generated_metadata":null}